            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">Rifles</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Bicycles (if taken); Infiltrators (if taken); Defend the Fatherland! (if taken); Add up to 2 men with rifles at +10pts (Regular), or 13pts (Veteran) each; The NCO may replace his rifle with a submachine gun for +4pts.; If the unit size is not increased beyond its initial 4 men, it can be equipped with bicycles for no points cost.; If the unit size is not increased beyond its initial 4 men, 1 unit per platoon may be upgraded to infiltrators for +1pt per figure. This option may not be taken if the unit takes bicycles.; Defend the Fatherland! (Fallschirmjäger, Waffen-SS, Gebirgsjäger)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 33</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
