            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">Rifles</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Shirkers; Tank hunters (if anti-tank grenades taken); Add up to 5 men with rifles for +5 pts each (Inexperienced) or +8pts each (Regular); The NCO and up to 2 men may replace their rifles with submachine guns for +4pts each; Up to 1 man may replace their rifle with a light machine gun for +15pts - another man becomes the loader; Up to 1 man may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts; The squad may be given anti-tank grenades for +2pts per figure</characteristic>
