            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Green; Tank Hunters (if anti-tank grenades are taken); Add up to 5 men with rifles for +7 pts each; The NCO &amp; up to 2 men may replace their rifles with submachine guns for +4pts; Up to 1 man may replace their rifle with a light machine gun for +15pts, another man becomes the loader; Up to 1 man may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts; The squad may be given anti-tank grenades for +2pts per figure</characteristic>
