            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Fanatics; Mixed Quality (if Inexperienced); Tank hunters (if anti-tank grenades taken); Add up to 7 men with rifles at +9pts (Inexperienced), +12pts (Regular), +15pts (Veteran); Anybody may replace their rifle with a submachine gun for +4pts each; Anybody may replace their rifle with an assault rifle for +6pts each; Up to 2 men may replace their rifle with a light machine gun for +15pts each - for each light machine gun included another man becomes the loader.; Up to 4 men may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts each; The squad may be given anti-tank grenades for +2pts per figure</characteristic>
