            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">Cavalry carbines (see below)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Fanatics; Cavalry (if horses taken); Cavalry Carbines: These short-barrelled rifles count as pistols when used from horseback, and rifles when used on foot; Add up to 5 men with carbines at +12pts (Regular), +16pts (Veteran) each; The NCO and up to 2 men may replace their carbines with submachine guns for +4pts each; Up to 2 men may replace their carbine with a light machine gun for +15pts each - for each light machine gun included another man becomes the loader; Up to 2 men may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts each; The squad may be mounted upon horses for +3pts per figure</characteristic>
