      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fallschirmjäger Squad (Late War)" hidden="false" id="ab42-cb63-3eab-9cc3" typeId="9b00-0000-0000-0001" typeName="Army Book Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Period" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0001">M/L</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Composition / Type" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0002">1 NCO and 4 men</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">, anti-tank guns and field artillery. Some units even gained armoured vehicles. The Luftwaffe developed their own assault rifle, the FG42, which was only issued to Fallschirmjäger units. Cost 70pts (Veteran) Composition 1 NCO and 4 men Weapons Rifles</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Tank hunters (if anti-tank grenades taken); Stubborn; Add up to 5 men with rifles at +14pts each; The NCO and up to 6 men may replace their rifles with submachine guns for +4pts each; The NCO and up to 6 men may replace their rifles with assault rifles for +6pts each; Up to 2 men may replace their rifle with a light machine gun for +15pts each - for each light machine gun included another man becomes the loader.; Up to 4 men may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts each</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 40</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
