    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Hitler Youth Squad" hidden="false" id="3843-9704-58a2-18d0">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="d42d-87f6-d04b-43db" id="eede-9b1b-10b5-cc42" primary="true" name="Infantry" />
        <categoryLink targetId="9e10-0000-0000-0003" id="b022-c795-8d9d-e2c0" primary="false" name="Period: Late War" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Hitler's Buzz-Saw" hidden="false" type="rule" id="0eae-5c73-a781-fd28" targetId="a300-0000-0000-0001" />
        <infoLink name="Initiative Training" hidden="false" type="rule" id="c260-c39a-98b6-f3d6" targetId="a300-0000-0000-0003" />
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Hitler Youth Squad" hidden="false" id="9912-ba9d-e621-c887" typeId="9b00-0000-0000-0001" typeName="Army Book Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Period" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0001">L</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Composition / Type" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0002">1 NCO and 4 men</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">training and expected to fight and die in defence of the Fatherland. Often the NCO was a veteran or an invalided soldier returning to duty. Despite their age, these boys often fought with great courage and tenacity, sacrificing themselves for a hopeless cause. Cost 40pts (Inexperienced) Composition 1 NCO and 4 men Weapons Rifles</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Party indoctrination: Hitler Youth squads are Green and must test when they first suffer a casualty as described in the rulebook. However, if Hitler Youth squads are uprated to Regular infantry as a result of the test, then roll a further die - on a roll of 5 or 6 they become Fanatics.; Bicycles (if taken); Add up to 5 men with rifles at +8pts each; The NCO may replace their rifle with a submachine gun for +4pts; Up to 5 men may have a panzerfaust in addition to other weapons for +15pts each; The squad may be equipped with bicycles for +1pt per figure</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 43</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Experience" id="9355-cd12-bee0-418d">
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="a824-e10f-17e6-3304" />
            <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="c85c-16c4-12cd-db67" />
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" name="Inexperienced" id="28a1-68c7-e586-ee47">
              <costs>
