        <infoLink name="Initiative Training" hidden="false" type="rule" id="289f-01df-64a6-40ba" targetId="a300-0000-0000-0003" />
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Panzer I Ausf. C" hidden="false" id="3566-630e-bee4-8ba1" typeId="9b00-0000-0000-0001" typeName="Army Book Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Period" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0001">L</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Composition / Type" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0002">8+ (Light Tank)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">1 turret-mounted EW 141 experimental gun and co-axial MMG</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">EW 141 experimental gun: Although the anti-tank rifle had seen its day, this weapon was quite effective firing a high velocity round combined with a squeeze bore barrel. It has the following profile:; Squeeze-bore: At ranges of up to 18”, its base armour penetration is increased by 1 to a total of +3.; Experimental: The relatively high rate of fire combined with the larger calibre round wore out the barrel quite quickly. When rolling to hit, if a double 1 is rolled, reduce the gun’s Shots value to 1 for the rest of the game.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 56</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="EW 141" hidden="false" id="b4ae-58f7-0c9a-804e" typeId="9b00-0000-0000-0002" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b02-0000-0000-0001">36"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Shots" typeId="9b02-0000-0000-0002">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Pen" typeId="9b02-0000-0000-0003">+2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9b02-0000-0000-0004">Squeeze-bore, experimental</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Experience" id="63dc-06c0-2089-06a1">
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="fbbe-132a-6222-878c" />
            <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="084d-6747-9693-0d76" />
          </constraints>
