            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">The 128mm Pak 44 was almost as effective at long ranges as at short range - so it does not suffer the -1 penetration penalty when shooting at targets at over half range. It counts its full +7 penetration bonus at all ranges.</characteristic>
