          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Period" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0001">M/L</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Composition / Type" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0002">8+ (light tank)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">but the crew carried an MG34 machine gun - which we allow them to make use of if required. Principal service: 1943-45. Numbers manufactured: 490. Cost 160pts (Inexperienced), 200pts (Regular), 240pts (Veteran) Weapons 1 forward-facing super-heavy anti-tank gun and 1 crew-carried MMG with 360-degree arc of fire</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Open-topped; The crew can either shoot the Nashorn’s main gun or the MMG, but not both</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 67</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
