            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">1 forward-facing light anti-tank gun</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Open-topped; Command vehicle; Squeeze-bore (Panzerbüchse 41): Counts as a light anti-tank gun. At ranges of up to 12”, its base armour penetration is increased to a total of +6, at over half range armour penetration is reduced by 2 instead of the usual 1 to a total of +2.; Recce (if option is taken); May add 1 pintle-mounted MMG covering the rear arc for +10pts; May replace the light anti-tank gun with a Panzerbüchse 41 for free (Sd.Kfz 250/11); May be given the Recce special rule for +10pts</characteristic>
