            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">1 turret-mounted MMG, 1 hull-mounted forward-facing MMG, 1 hull-mounted rear-facing MMG</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Recce (dual direction steering) TRANSPORTS AND TOWS The German Army had a large range of half-tracked vehicles as transports and tows, and even converted soft skin lorries to half-tracks to enable them to cope with conditions on the Russian Front.; Replace the turret-mounted MMG with a light automatic cannon for +20pts</characteristic>
