          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Period" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0001">E/M/L</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Composition / Type" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0002">7+ (armoured carrier) Transport Up to 5 men Tow Light howitzer; light or medium anti-tank gun; light anti-aircraft gun.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Weapons" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0003">. Due to delays, it did not enter service until 1941, and was never as common as the 251. Principal service: 1941-45. Numbers manufactured: 6,500 all variants. Cost 44pts (Inexperienced), 55pts (Regular), 66pts (Veteran) Weapons 1 pintle-mounted MMG covering the forward arc</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Rules and options" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0004">Open-topped; May add 1 pintle-mounted MMG covering the rear arc for +10pts; May replace the pintle-mounted MMG covering the front arc with 2 pintle-mounted MMGs covering the front arc for +10pts (representing the 250/4 prototype)</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Army Book" typeId="9b01-0000-0000-0005">p. 87</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
